    "灰色のブロックは壊れません。残っていてもステージクリアできます。" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Gray blocks can't be broken. You can clear the stage with them still there."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "球が増えているときは、全部落ちるまでミスになりません。" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "With extra balls in play, you only lose a life once every ball is gone."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "球を落とすと 1 ミス" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Drop all balls: 1 miss"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "発射待ち" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Ready to launch"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "盤の球をすべて落とすと 1 ミス。3 回ミスで終わりです。" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Losing all your balls costs a life. The game ends after 3."
          }
        }
      }
    },
