      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Quit & Start Over"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "落ちてくるアイテムをパドルで受けると、パドルが伸びたり球が増えたりします。" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Catch falling items to get a longer paddle or extra balls."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "途中で終了すると今のスコアとステージが失われます。" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "If you quit now, your current score and stage will be lost."
